        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Plainview, Jeffersontown, Kentucky, Jefferson County, Louisville, United States\n- Companies: Papa John's Pizza, Papa John's International, Inc.\n- People: John H. Schnatter\n- Topics: population, headquarters, pizza delivery\n\nFacts:\n- John H. Schnatter was born on November 22, 1961.\n- John H. Schnatter is an American entrepreneur and the founder, CEO, and spokesman of Papa John's International, Inc.\n- In 2010, Jeffersontown, Kentucky had a population of 26,595 according to the U.S. census.\n- Jeffersontown is a home rule-class city in Jefferson County, Kentucky, United States.\n- Plainview is a neighborhood in the city of Jeffersontown, Kentucky.\n- Plainview is located on the former site of the Plainview Dairy Farm.\n- Papa John's Pizza operates the third largest take-out and pizza delivery restaurant chain in the United States.\n- Papa John's Pizza has its headquarters in Jeffersontown, Kentucky, a suburb of Louisville.",
